    (property "Description" "Radxa Dragon Q6A 40-pin GPIO header (on the Q6A board; the harness mates to it). Pin numbers and names per Radxa docs pin-gpio (Function0 GPIO_n plus the STACK function) and Q6A schematic v1.21 p.24 (e.g. pin 27 QUPSE2_I2C_SDA_3V3, 28 QUPSE2_I2C_SCL_3V3). 3.3 V logic via on-board UM3304/UM3204H/CJ3134K translators. Pin types follow STACK v2 section 5.2: inputs left, outputs right, unused GPIO bidirectional on the right. Pins 17 (3V3) and 4 (5V) are passive duplicates of 1 and 2."
