    (property "Description" "External IMU pack (Adafruit BNO085 4754 + Waveshare RP2040-Zero 20187 in Hammond 1550Z101), reached through the Olimex GX16-4 body socket: 5 V (Schottky at the pack input), TX, RX, GND, braid on the GX16 shell. STACK v2 5.2 \"Other buses\". Port IDs are symbolic; the GX16-4 contact numbers are not given in STACK (TBD). Pack TX goes to Pico GP9 (UART1 RX), pack RX from Pico GP8 (UART1 TX), 115200, frames with CRC."
      (at 0 -10.16 0)
      (effects
        (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      )
      (hide yes)
    )
