        (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      )
      (hide yes)
    )
    (property "Description" "Adafruit 5997 CH334F 4-port USB 2.0 hub breakout (MTT). Per Adafruit schematic rev C: upstream pads JP5 (silk USBHOST) 1 VBUS, 2 DPH (D+), 3 DMH (D-), 4 GND; downstream pads (silk PORT1-4) JP2 = hub port 1 (D+1/D-1), JP1 = port 2, JP3 = port 3, JP4 = port 4, each 1 VBUS, 2 D+, 3 D-, 4 GND. JP5-1 and pad 1 of every port are one VBUS net (100 uF each, C3-C6) that reaches the CH334F V5 through PTC2 5V/2A. STACK H1-H4 = hub ports 1-4; pad 1 of H2/H3/H4 must stay unconnected (STACK v2 5.2). The USB-C upstream receptacle is not drawn."
      (at 0 -10.16 0)
      (effects
        (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      )
      (hide yes)
    )
    (property "ki_keywords" "USB hub CH334F Adafruit breakout MTT"
