    (property "Description" "LimeSDR Micro M.2 2280 v1.2 (LMS7002M + LA9310), B+M key edge X9, PCIe Gen3 x1, powered only from 3.3 V on the M.2 edge. Edge pins and names per myriadrf v1.2 \"M.2 edge connector\" (Table 14, LimeSDR schematic names; NC pins not drawn). RF MHF4 connectors per v1.2 overview: X1 TX, X2 RX, X4 RX (X3 RX AUX removed in v1.1, changelog); J4 MHF4 external reference clock input 10-52 MHz, 1.8-3.3 V (also on edge pin 28). RX-only build: X1 goes only to the ANNE-50+ load (STACK v2 2.11.1, 5.3). X1/X2/X4/J4 IDs are the board designators; *S pins are the MHF4 shells."
      (at 0 -10.16 0)
      (effects
        (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      )
