    (property "Description" "Aratas (formerly Omron) G6K-2F-RF / G6K-2F-RF-S DC5 surface-mount high-frequency DPDT relay. Terminal arrangement (top view) per datasheet: coil 1 (+) / 8 (-); pole 1 COM 3, NC 2, NO 4; pole 2 COM 6, NC 7, NO 5; two case ground terminals (G). The datasheet does not number the ground terminals: named G1/G2 here, the footprint must use the same IDs. Coil polarity matters."
